          "kicker": "Head to head",
          "heading": "Fiji take level six-all record against Italy into Saturday's Udine test",
          "body": "The ledger with the Azzurri could hardly be tighter: across 12 meetings, Fiji and Italy have six wins apiece, according to OnRugby. The sides have not met since November 2017, when Italy won 19-10 in Catania. Both arrive in Udine without a Nations Championship win and bottom of their respective pools, and the Italian outlet reckons they could well meet again in London on the tournament's final weekend. Fiji come off a 15-43 defeat to Ireland in Dublin, where they failed to score in the second half."
