          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Fabien Galthié recalls Matthieu Jalibert at fly-half and overhauls France's back row",
          "body": "France head coach Fabien Galthié has made four changes for Saturday's Round 6 test against Argentina at the Stade de France. Bordeaux-Bègles' Matthieu Jalibert starts at No. 10 in his first outing of any kind since September after injury, sending Maxime Lucu to the bench. In the back row, Anthony Jelonch returns at No. 8 between flankers Charles Ollivon and Esteban Capilla, with Grégory Alldritt and Cameron Woki dropping to the replacements. Louis Bielle-Biarrey, managed during the week, keeps his place on the wing."
        },
