          "heading": "Gonzalo Quesada names Italy side for Fiji and confirms Domingo's opportunity",
          "body": "Italy head coach Gonzalo Quesada has announced his side for the Round 6 Nations Championship test against Fiji at Udine's Bluenergy Stadium. He used his press conference to confirm that Domingo will get his chance. Quesada said the plan from the outset had been to play him against Fiji, then weigh whether to start him. He also called Fiji a side with quality and said he expects a tight game. Italy go into the weekend 11th of 12, still winless after a 14-19 defeat to Argentina."
