          "kicker": "Russell cover",
          "heading": "Scotland turn to Tom Jordan to fill Finn Russell gap before Japan",
          "body": "Tom Jordan gets the call to cover for fly-half Finn Russell before Saturday's Nations Championship finale against Japan, and there is more bad news up front: a Scotland forward is undergoing an operation. The squad was already stretched: captain Sione Tuipulotu, scrum-half Ben White, number eight Jack Dempsey and lock Scott Cummings were ruled out of the Japan game earlier in the week, with Edinburgh forwards Grant Gilchrist and Magnus Bradbury and Leicester lock Cam Henderson called up. Glasgow's Rory Darge now captains the squad."
