          "heading": "Julián Montoya returns as captain in seven Pumas changes for France",
          "body": "Head coach Felipe Contepomi has reshaped his side after last week's 19-14 win over Italy. Montoya, the captain, missed that game and now takes the hooker's shirt from the injured Bautista Bernasconi for Saturday's Nations Championship meeting with France. Tomás Lavanini replaces Pedro Rubiolo at lock. Juan Martín González is restored to the back row and Pablo Matera drops to the bench. Facundo Isa starts at No. 8, which moves Juan Martín Scelzo to openside. Gerónimo Prisciantelli takes over at full-back, and Rodrigo Isgró moves to the bench."
